430
00:58:57,199 --> 00:59:13,299
心の声を繋ぐのが これほど怖いものだとは 君と僕が声を合わせ 今までの過去なんてなかったかのように歌い出すんだ
Who knew connecting our hearts with our voices could be this terrifying? As you and me harmonize our voices, I start to sing as if our pasts up until now never existed.

431
